# Allow-list: everything is excluded unless re-included below, so a new private file can never
# slip into the build context. data/private, data/warehouse, .git, .env, tests... are all out.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!dbt_project/macros
!dbt_project/models/marts
!data/demo/demo.duckdb
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
